---
description: Brand colors from design tokens only
globs: "{apps/mobile,apps/web-admin}/**/*.{dart,tsx,css}"
alwaysApply: false
---

Do not hardcode hex colors. Use packages/design-tokens (Flutter theme / CSS variables). `#C1C8E4` and `#84CEEB` are not text colors. Primary `#5680E9`, accent `#8860D0`. Financial success/danger are separate semantic tokens, not recolored primary.
